  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">This specification defines "jCal", a JSON format for iCalendar data. The iCalendar data format is a text format for capturing and exchanging information normally stored within a calendaring and scheduling application, for example, tasks and events.  JSON is a lightweight, text-based, language-independent data interchange format commonly used in Internet applications.</abstract>
